    "about": { "text": "Figure 2: embodied (A1-A3) and operational carbon per storey, synthetic values from nrc_analytics_storeys.csv. The file's Building row is the sum of the four storeys, not a fifth one, so the chart leaves it out and buildingTotal shows it. named gives the two series readable names for the legend." },
